    "chapter": "Properties of matter and fluid mechanics",
    "question": "<h3>The volume contraction of a solid copper cube, when subjected to a hydraulic pressure of <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&times;</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mrow></math>, would be <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi></mrow></math> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></math>.</h3>\n\n<h3>(Given bulk modulus of copper <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1.4</mn><mi>&times;</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&minus;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></math> )</h3>\n",
    "solution": "<h3><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&Delta;</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&Delta;</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></math></h3>\n\n<h3><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>&Delta;</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&times;</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1.4</mn><mi>&times;</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>&times;</mi><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"true\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&times;</mi><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&minus;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\" form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mstyle></math></h3>\n\n<h3><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>&Delta;</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><msup><mrow><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></math></h3>\n",
    "answer": "50",
